    {
      "id": "p37",
      "title": "Timing",
      "titleArabic": "",
      "hint": "Madd waw ـُو and madd yaa ـِى are 2 counts too.\nThe small alif ـٰ over ى means you say an alif: مُوسَىٰ = Moosaa. 2 counts."
    },
    {
      "id": "p38",
      "title": "Timing",
      "titleArabic": "",
      "hint": "The small ۥ after ـهُ means say a waw; the small ۦ after ـهِ means say a yaa: لَهُۥ = لَهُو. 2 counts."
    }
